{"meta":{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","type":"tv","name":"The New Detectives","logo":"https://i.imgur.com/GLXg9ge.png","poster":"https://i.imgur.com/GLXg9ge.png","posterShape":"square","genres":["English Entertainment"],"channelNumber":1072,"behaviorHints":{"isLive":true,"defaultVideoId":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us"},"videos":[{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives – Live","released":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives – Live","released":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives – Live","released":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T08:47:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T08:47:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T08:47:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T09:50:00Z","overview":"Hiding a body can be difficult; it's sometimes easier to obscure or disguise the circumstances of the death, turning murder into suicide, or pinning the blame on someone else. The truth is told through subtle clues taken from the crime scene.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T09:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T09:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","overview":"The forces of nature can reduce a body to bones in a matter of weeks. Using a unique combination of art and science, forensic anthropologists give victims a face long after they have been forgotten.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T11:49:00Z","overview":"Using science as their most powerful weapon, investigators must find these hired killers and make them pay the true price of murder.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T11:49:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:49:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:48:00Z","overview":"A victim usually never foresees danger when the perpetrator turns out to be a friend or a lover. Science and microscopic evidence can unmask these killers and find justice for those who are Loved To Death.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T12:48:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:48:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:50:00Z","overview":"When a theft is committed, something valuable is stolen. But when a criminal needs a new identity, theft becomes a matter of life and death.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T13:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:49:00Z","overview":"Solving crimes may begin with gut intuition, but advanced science provides investigators with irrefutable proof. When criminals go to great lengths to mask their crimes, Investigators must step up the challenge and remain forever undaunted.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T14:49:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:49:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:51:00Z","overview":"Some cases simply can't be solved with current technology or with the evidence at hand. But that doesn't mean they'll remain unsolved forever.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T15:51:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:51:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","overview":"Forensic scientists find clues written in blood as they investigate the deaths of three women killed by the men who once loved them.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:53:00Z","overview":"For homicide investigators, it's a race against time as they track their deadliest foe: a serial killer for whom killing is the only way to feel alive.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T17:53:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:53:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:54:00Z","overview":"When lovers turn on each other, or marriages fail, some ruthless spouses find a grisly way to gain an uncontested divorce with no paperwork. When murder tears lovers apart, forensic science must put piece together the mystery to catch the killer.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T18:54:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:54:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:55:00Z","overview":"Photography has long been a vital tool in homicide investigations. A single image captures enough information to identify a suspect, and to preserve a vital clue long after a witness' memory fades.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T19:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:55:00Z","overview":"A woman's body is found and investigators have little time and few clues to lead them to a killer who could strike again. Perpetrators try to conceal their crimes, yet savvy investigators can take the most obscure data and recreate a murder.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T20:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:58:00Z","overview":"Black Boxes: Little evidence is left after an airplane takes a deadly plunge from the sky. Investigators' best hope for an answer comes from the flight data recorder known as a black box.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T21:58:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:58:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","overview":"Forensic Entomology: Bugs have roamed the earth for 250 million years, but their intimate association with death is just now coming to life.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","overview":"When abduction turns to murder, forensic science is the only key to finding justice for the victims of a kidnapper's deadly intentions.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:59:00Z","overview":"A southeastern Virginia community is stunned by a crime no one can believe. A pregnant woman murdered, her baby lost. Across the state, another town feels a similar shock, a brutal, random slaying in a most unexpected setting.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives","released":"2026-11-29T00:59:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:59:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T02:01:00Z","overview":"Toxicology: While drugs can cure disease and ease pain, they can also be agents of murder. Toxicologists can examine blood and tissue to uncover cases where death is not as natural as it may seemfrom slow arsenic poisoning to quick cocaine overdoses.","genres":["Series","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives – Live","released":"2026-11-29T02:01:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T02:01:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheNewDetectives_us","title":"The New Detectives – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","